  <diagram id="sec2" name="② Metrics">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="470" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="sec2" value="② Metrics —— 进程内计数 + 固定桶直方图（客户端侧）" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=28;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#888888;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="1820" height="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2n1" value="StartMetricsReport&#xa;rpc_channel.cpp:607  RunInLoop 设 interval&#xa;interval=0 → 直接返回（关）" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="sec2">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="50" width="280" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2n2" value="rpc_channel.cpp:621  RunAfter(interval)&#xa;第一份报告在「一个周期之后」&#xa;（启动瞬间分母≈0，QPS 被放大成噪声）" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="sec2">
          <mxGeometry x="340" y="50" width="320" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2n3" value="rpc_channel.cpp:656  ReportMetricsInLoop（自驱动）&#xa;elapsed = now - metrics_window_start_&#xa;count = TakeCycleCount() ← 「结清」本周期&#xa;qps = count / elapsed秒" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="sec2">
          <mxGeometry x="690" y="50" width="340" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2n4" value="rpc_channel.cpp:677  NLOG_INFO&#xa;rpc metrics qps=… in_flight=…&#xa;+ Dump()" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="sec2">
          <mxGeometry x="1060" y="50" width="240" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2n5" value="rpc_channel.cpp 收尾&#xa;:682 metrics_window_start_ = now&#xa;:685 再 RunAfter(interval) 调自己" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="sec2">
          <mxGeometry x="1330" y="50" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2n6" value="rpc_channel.cpp —— 三类被拦下&#xa;:291 / :301 / :318&#xa;（不写进表，这类请求永远看不到）" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="sec2">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="190" width="300" height="95" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2n7" value="rpc_channel.cpp:765&#xa;CompleteCallWithFrame&#xa;响应到达，含对端 ERROR 帧" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="sec2">
          <mxGeometry x="360" y="190" width="280" height="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2n8" value="rpc_channel.cpp:871  RecordMetrics&#xa;返回实测延迟&#xa;→ 日志与指标共用同一份数字" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="sec2">
          <mxGeometry x="670" y="190" width="280" height="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2n9" value="rpc_metrics.h:18  LatencyHistogram&#xa;:25 kBoundsUs = 1/5/10/50/100/500/1000ms + 溢出桶 = 8 桶&#xa;PercentileUs：找第一个「累计占比 ≥ p」的桶 → 返回桶上界&#xa;落溢出桶返回 -1 → Dump 打印成 &gt;1000ms" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="sec2">
          <mxGeometry x="980" y="180" width="400" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2n10" value="rpc_metrics.h:42  MethodMetrics&#xa;total / failed / timeout&#xa;+ latency" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="sec2">
          <mxGeometry x="1410" y="190" width="240" height="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2note" value="⚠ P50=5ms 的意思是「中位数落在 5ms 这个桶里」，不是「恰好 5ms」——固定桶的代价是分位数有桶宽误差，换来的是内存恒定（不存样本）。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="sec2">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="310" width="1670" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="sec2" source="s2n1" target="s2n2">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="sec2" source="s2n2" target="s2n3">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2e3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="sec2" source="s2n3" target="s2n4">
